Third-party material in samples/
--------------------------------
The test projects in samples/ (.zap21/.zal21 archives and project folders) were created for this project with
Siemens TIA Portal V21. Besides the test content written for this project they contain material owned by
Siemens AG that TIA Portal adds to every project, in particular compiled system blocks and instructions
(e.g. IEC timers and counters, PID and technology objects, safety system blocks), hardware catalog data,
HMI styles and system text lists. That material remains the property of Siemens AG; it is not licensed under
the MPL-2.0 and is included only as test data for interoperability purposes.

